nt-weight: bold;\">\n\t<p style=\"color: blue;\"><u>Coastal Weather Bulletin</u></p>\n\t\t<p >DAILY ONE Bulletin Valid for 12 hrs from 22 UTC of 2026-09-03 \n\t\tto 10 UTC of 2026-09-04</p>\n\n<!--\t<p id='datetime'></p>-->\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"tr caption\">&nbsp;</div>\t\n<table class=\"tr\">\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Synoptic Situation</td>\n\t\t<td >NIL.</td>\n\t</tr>\n</table>\n<br>\n\n<div class=\"tr caption\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\n<!-- Layer -->\n<table class=\"tr \">\n\t<caption class=\"caption\">\n\t\tNorth Tamilnadu coast\t</caption>\n\t\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Wind</td>\n\t\t<td >SOUTHERLY/SOUTHWESTERLY 10-15 KNOTS GUSTING TO 20                                                     KNOTS OCCASSIONALLY.</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Weather</td>\n\t\t<td >ISOLATED RAIN/THUNDERSHOWERS.</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Visibility</td>\n\t\t<td >GOOD BECOMING POOR IN RAIN/THUNDERSHOWERS.</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Sea Condition</td>\n\t\t<td >SLIGHT TO MODERATE.</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Port Signal</td>\n\t\t<td >NIL AT ALL PORTS</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Storm Surge/Tidal Warning</td>\n\t\t<td >OCEAN CURRENTS ALERT FOR THE COAST OF CHENNAI, TAMIL NADU FROM PALAVAKKAM TO LAKSHMIPURAM ODAIKUPPAM. SURFACE CURRENT SPEEDS IN THE RANGE OF 1.4 - 1.6 M/SEC ARE FORECASTED DURING 16:00 HOURS ON 02-09-2026 TO 19:00 HOURS ON 04-09-2026. IT ADVISED THAT HARBOUR & MARINE OPERATIONS TO BE CAREFUL.\r\nOCEAN CURRENTS ALERT FOR THE COAST OF CUDDALORE, TAMIL NADU FROM KILLAI TO MOORTHIPUDUKUPPAM. SURFACE CURRENT SPEEDS IN THE RANGE OF 1.0 - 1.0 M/SEC ARE FORECASTED DURING 22:00 HOURS ON 02-09-2026 TO 01:00</td>\n\t</tr>\n</table>\n<br>\n\t\n<!-- Layer -->\n<table class=\"tr \">\n\t<caption class=\"caption\">\n\t\tSouth Tamilnadu coast\t</caption>\n\t\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Wind</td>\n\t\t<td >MAINLY SOUTHWESTERLY 15-20 KNOTS GUSTING TO 25                                                  KNOTS OCCASSIONALLY.</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Weather</td>\n\t\t<td >ISOLATED RAIN/THUNDERSHOWERS.</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Visibility</td>\n\t\t<td >GOOD; BECOMING POOR IN RAIN/ THUNDERSHOWERS.</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Sea Condition</td>\n\t\t<td >SLIGHT TO MODERATE; BECOMING ROUGH IN GUST.</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Port Signal</td>\n\t\t<td >NIL AT ALL PORTS</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td class=\"td-1\">Storm Surge/Tidal Warning</td>\n\t\t<td >NIL</td>\n\t</tr>\n</table>\n<br>\n\t\n\n<table class=\"tr \"><tr><td class=\"td-1\">Time of Issue</td><td>20:36 IST of 2026-09-03</td></tr></table>\n\t\n</div>\n</body>\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n\tvar date = new Date(); \n\tvar tomorrow = date.getDate()+1+'-'+(date.getMonth()+1)+'-'+date.getFullYear();\n\tvar today = date.getDate()+'-'+(date.getMonth()+1)+'-'+date.getFullYear();\n\t\t\t\n\tdocument.getElementById(\"datetime\").innerHTML = \"Daily Bulletin Valid for 12 Hours From \"+today+\" to \"+tomorrow;\n\t\n\tdocument.getElementById(\"date-right\").innerHTML = today;\n\t\t</script>\n\n</html>", "meta": {"status": 200, "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "latency_ms": 195}}